      "title": "5. PID in Action",
      "gist": "Empirical PID studies of cortical recordings show synergy concentrates in richly connected hubs, grows with recurrent connections, peaks at intermediate input correlation, and shifts with behavioral task demands.",
      "question": "PID in action — where and why does synergistic computation concentrate in real neural circuits? (empirical findings)",
      "sourceHeading": "5. PID in Action"
    },
