      ],
      "title": "Recording and Decomposing Cortical Circuits",
      "gist": "Using 512-channel arrays on mouse cortical cultures, the authors built effective networks via transfer entropy, decomposed thousands of neuron triads with PID, and found synergy tracked feedforward information strongly."
    },
